      "text": "Thomas, a longtime Porsche enthusiast, never imagined—“not in a million years,” as he puts it—that he would go from being a Tesla critic to a passionate Model Y owner. Today, he owns three Teslas, completely transforming the lineup in his garage.\n\nThere’s a good reason Model Y has been the world’s best-selling vehicle of any kind, ICE or EV, for several years running.\n\nWatch this sports car guru explain what changed his mind and why he became such a big Model Y proponent:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/khBaMSoSYAk?is=la_x0ifmunex8d3h",
